OTG mode3 and SMB1360 VBUS supply. This session did not reacquire that evidence.
The vendor release is not proved identical to that running kernel. The parent
backed up boot/recovery/aboot/abootbak and erased only boot with permission;
normal reboot returns to unlocked stock fastboot. No phone state was altered.
No claim is made of measured 5V, current capability, PMIC USBIN wiring, safe
charger/boost isolation, full OTG protocol compliance, or working role changes.

